8085\"may|strong=\"H8085\"make|strong=\"H8085\"the|strong=\"H3605\"voice|strong=\"H6963\"of|strong=\"H6963\"thanksgiving|strong=\"H8426\"to|strong=\"H8085\"be|strong=\"H6963\"heard|strong=\"H8085\"and|strong=\"H6963\"tell|strong=\"H5608\"of|strong=\"H6963\"all|strong=\"H3605\"your|strong=\"H3605\"wondrous|strong=\"H6381\"deeds|strong=\"H6381\".   \n"},{"number":8,"text":"LORD|strong=\"H3068\", I|strong=\"H3068\"love the|strong=\"H3068\"habitation|strong=\"H4583\"of|strong=\"H1004\"your|strong=\"H3068\"house|strong=\"H1004\",  \nthe|strong=\"H3068\"place|strong=\"H4725\"where|strong=\"H4725\"your|strong=\"H3068\"glory|strong=\"H3519\"dwells|strong=\"H4908\".   \n"},{"number":9,"text":"Don’t gather my|strong=\"H5973\"soul|strong=\"H5315\"with|strong=\"H5973\"sinners|strong=\"H2400\",  \nnor my|strong=\"H5973\"life|strong=\"H5315\"with|strong=\"H5973\"bloodthirsty men|strong=\"H5315\""},{"number":10,"text":"in|strong=\"H3027\"whose hands|strong=\"H3027\"is|strong=\"H3027\"wickedness|strong=\"H2154\";  \ntheir|strong=\"H4390\"right|strong=\"H3225\"hand|strong=\"H3027\"is|strong=\"H3027\"full|strong=\"H4390\"of|strong=\"H3027\"bribes|strong=\"H7810\".   \n"},{"number":11,"text":"But as for|strong=\"H3212\"me|strong=\"H2603\", I|strong=\"H3212\"will walk|strong=\"H3212\"in|strong=\"H3212\"my|strong=\"H6299\"integrity|strong=\"H8537\".  \nRedeem|strong=\"H6299\"me|strong=\"H2603\", and|strong=\"H3212\"be|strong=\"H2603\"merciful|strong=\"H2603\"to|strong=\"H3212\"me|strong=\"H2603\".   \n"},{"number":12,"text":"My|strong=\"H3068\"foot|strong=\"H7272\"stands|strong=\"H5975\"in|strong=\"H3068\"an|strong=\"H3068\"even|strong=\"H3068\"place|strong=\"H4334\".  \nIn|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3068\"congregations|strong=\"H4721\"I|strong=\"H3068\"will|strong=\"H3068\"bless|strong=\"H1288\"the|strong=\"H3068\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\".   \n"}]}
